/T (Day 1 of the preliminary rounds commenced with briefings for judges, participants, and OC members to ensure smooth proceedings. The rounds followed a structured format: 20 minutes of client counselling, during which counsels engaged with clients to understand their legal position and available options, followed by a 10-minute post-consultation discussion. This was succeeded by feedback and scoring. )
/E (Day 1 of the preliminary rounds commenced with briefings for judges, participants, and OC members to ensure smooth proceedings. The rounds followed a structured format: 20 minutes of client counselling, during which counsels engaged with clients to understand their legal position and available options, followed by a 10-minute post-consultation discussion. This was succeeded by feedback and scoring. )
