/E (The clients, here, played a pivotal role, demonstrating their ability to articulate concerns, provide crucial insights, and engage effectively with the counsels, contributing significantly to the overall dynamics of the competition and influencing its outcome. The counsels  showcased their ability to build client trust, analyse legal issues, and provide strategic guidance with professionalism  and empathy. )
