/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Advanced rounds commenced with an inspiring Inaugural Ceremony graced by Mr. Vishnu Shriram, Partner at Khaitan & Co., who joined as the Chief Guest. In his address, Mr. Shriram encouraged participants to treat client interactions as central to their professional identity and reminded them that in the real world, good counsel is often measured by emotional intelligence as much as intellectual clarity. Welcoming the gathering, Dr. Kiran Rai, Director of CTRCR, spoke about the growing need for practical exposure in legal education and emphasized how events like this bridge the crucial gap between theoretical training and the demands of professional life. Her guidance and unwavering support were instrumental in shaping every aspect of the event, from design to execution. )
/E (The Advanced rounds commenced with an inspiring Inaugural Ceremony graced by Mr. Vishnu Shriram, Partner at Khaitan & Co., who joined as the Chief Guest. In his address, Mr. Shriram encouraged participants to treat client interactions as central to their professional identity and reminded them that in the real world, good counsel is often measured by emotional intelligence as much as intellectual clarity. Welcoming the gathering, Dr. Kiran Rai, Director of CTRCR, spoke about the growing need for practical exposure in legal education and emphasized how events like this bridge the crucial gap between theoretical training and the demands of professional life. Her guidance and unwavering support were instrumental in shaping every aspect of the event, from design to execution. )
