396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Post semi-finals and lunch, the curtains rose on the most awaited round of the competition- the Grand Finale. The two finalists, Thalia from RGNUL and Erebus \(Open Team\) from NLSIU, walked into the final room knowing that every word, every gesture, and every argument could tip the scales. What followed was a battle of minds and methods, where both teams impressed with their articulation, strategy, and depth of analysis.)
